Phase 8.2 - Accelerate empty-space traversal with an unsigned distance field
  Depends on: Phase 8.1's selected density-support contract; Phase 8 baseline review.
  Outcome: evaluate conservative empty-space stepping without changing occupied integration;
    retain it only with useful measured total benefit, otherwise remove the prototype.
