  [x] Select resolution, format and construction algorithm with a conservative error proof. Account
      for anisotropy, finite guards, circular adjacency, quantization and cell/sample-position offsets.
      Approximate nearest-seed algorithms can overestimate safe distance; correct/bound that error
      rather than assuming a propagated nearest seed or trilinear distance sample is conservative.
  [x] Budget resident/peak field storage, construction scratch and publication lifetime before
      allocation. Full-resolution R16F alone is35,009,700bytes (about33.4MiB) at515x66x515; charge
      all additional resources against the agreed ceilings. Evaluate coarser storage explicitly,
      with its lost skipping precision and safety allowance; no uncounted spares or silent coverage cut.
